OL,3,GNEWSAScilly Isles ferry on emotional
OL,4,Afinal voyage
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have arrived to mark
OL,7,Fthe end of an era as the Scillonian III
OL,8,Fmakes its final passenger sailing
OL,9,Fbetween Penzance and the Isles of
OL,10,FScilly.
OL,12,FThe ship, which can carry 486
OL,13,Fpassengers, departed from Penzance at
OL,14,F09:00 GMT and has arrived at St Mary's.
OL,16,FThe ferry, which has served generations
OL,17,Fof islanders, visitors and businesses,
OL,18,Fis due to leave St Mary's at 14:00 for
OL,19,Fthe last time as part of a farewell day
OL,20,Forganised by the Isles of Scilly
OL,21,FSteamship Group.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
